The Appkis Sound Effects software is a live sound effect assistant software. The software includes four categories: host, shouting, funny and game, with a total of 160 sound effect buttons.

Special Feature:
1. Support playing background music and playing sound effects at the same time;
2. Background music supports fade in and fade out;
3. Support setting shortcut keys;
4. Support the Talk function, press the space bar to lower the volume and restore the volume;
5. Support to replace the sound effect on each button;
6. Support batch adding sound effects, support drag and drop mode;
7. Support batch adding background music, support drag and drop mode;
8. Supports moving sound effects by dragging, cutting and pasting or cutting and swapping positions;
9. Support mini mode, which can be displayed in four positions: top, bottom, left and right.


